ng house `i` gives `best(i-2) + nums[i]`, skipping it gives `best(i-1)`. Only two previous values are needed. O(n) time, O(1) space."},"cpp":"class Solution {\npublic:\n    int rob(vector<int>& nums) {\n        int prev2 = 0, prev1 = 0;\n        for (int x : nums) {\n            int cur = max(prev1, prev2 + x);\n            prev2 = prev1;\n            prev1 = cur;\n        }\n        return prev1;\n    }\n};"}}